Package: Sensabled
Title: Visualizing and Analyzing Statistics of Categorical Data
Version: 1.2.1.000
Authors@R: 
    person("Sumit", "Sen", , "sumitsen616@outlook.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides an interactive, no-code graphical workflow for visualizing and statistically analyzing discrete and categorical data. Enables users to generate publication-ready plots and statistical     reports without requiring R coding knowledge.
